23	    own heuristic says a keyboard focus ring is warranted, which a
24	    mouse-click-focused <button> never satisfies in any evergreen engine,
25	    while genuine Tab navigation still does — so keyboard parity (the
26	    reason a focus-based reveal exists at all) is preserved and the
